## A matte unit sphere lit by one distant light from the eye's side, under
## Option "pathtracer" "integer samples". AGENTS.md's desync convention: the
## request under test, then a Sphere, so a mis-counted parameter list fails
## the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "pathtracer_samples.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 32 32 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [2]
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [1] "from" [0 0 0] "to" [0 0 1]
Surface "matte"
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
